# Pairs with NoFalseAbsence. The caller records no change when the anchor
# reads the same as its base, and an absent anchor that is absent again reads
# the same, so a create undone by a later delete before the finalize is
# recorded as no change.
MODULE: AuditFinalizeJudgesByAnchor
TARGET: NoFalseAbsence
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the caller decides no change from anchor equality alone
PERTURBS: Finalize

--- FIND
                     [] op[o].changed -> "Committed"
                     [] movement = "Unmoved" -> "NoChange"
                     [] OTHER -> "Indeterminate"
--- REPLACE
                     [] Obs = op[o].base -> "NoChange"
                     [] OTHER -> "Committed"
--- END
